<title>HONG KONG: Asia Securities mulls sale of Redhill.</title>
<headline>Asia Securities mulls sale of Redhill.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Securities International Ltd said on Tuesday it had made &quot;preliminary contacts&quot; with the Sino Group regarding a proposed sale of its 33 percent stake in the Redhill property development on Hong Kong Island.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that details of the proposed sale have not yet been discussed.</p>
<p>Asia Securities International shares rose HK$0.325 on Monday to close at HK$3.05.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
